{
  "$defs": {
    "PointInTimeStatus": {
      "description": "单个 `observation_key` 在一个 PIT 时刻的结果（ADR-0023 §5 第 4 步）。",
      "enum": [
        "selected",
        "absent",
        "conflict"
      ],
      "title": "PointInTimeStatus",
      "type": "string"
    }
  },
  "additionalProperties": false,
  "description": "单个 `observation_key` 在 `(simulation_time, knowledge_cutoff)` 下的 PIT 结果形状。\n\n- `selected`：恰好一个 maximal head，`selected_revision_id` 即它，`maximal_heads == (它,)`；\n- `absent`：没有候选，无 selected、无 head；\n- `conflict`：至少两个 maximal heads，**不得**携带 selected revision；数据集构建必须\n  fail closed，禁止以 `arrival_seq`、墙钟或 payload hash 打破。\n\n`maximal_heads` 是集合语义（去重、按 ID 规范排序，不表示先后）。这是**输出契约，不是选择算法**：\nheads 是否真的是候选集中互不排序的 maximal 元素，属于批次 F 的执行器，契约层无法证明。",
  "properties": {
    "schema_version": {
      "default": "2.6.0",
      "pattern": "^(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*)\\.(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*)\\.(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*)(?:-(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*|[0-9]*[a-zA-Z-][0-9a-zA-Z-]*)(?:\\.(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*|[0-9]*[a-zA-Z-][0-9a-zA-Z-]*))*)?(?:\\+[0-9a-zA-Z-]+(?:\\.[0-9a-zA-Z-]+)*)?$",
      "title": "Schema Version",
      "type": "string"
    },
    "observation_key": {
      "minLength": 1,
      "title": "Observation Key",
      "type": "string"
    },
    "simulation_time": {
      "format": "date-time",
      "title": "Simulation Time",
      "type": "string"
    },
    "knowledge_cutoff": {
      "format": "date-time",
      "title": "Knowledge Cutoff",
      "type": "string"
    },
    "status": {
      "$ref": "#/$defs/PointInTimeStatus"
    },
    "selected_revision_id": {
      "anyOf": [
        {
          "minLength": 1,
          "type": "string"
        },
        {
          "type": "null"
        }
      ],
      "default": null,
      "title": "Selected Revision Id"
    },
    "maximal_heads": {
      "default": [],
      "items": {
        "minLength": 1,
        "type": "string"
      },
      "title": "Maximal Heads",
      "type": "array",
      "uniqueItems": true
    }
  },
  "required": [
    "observation_key",
    "simulation_time",
    "knowledge_cutoff",
    "status"
  ],
  "title": "PointInTimeSelection",
  "type": "object"
}
